cor pieces. This comprehensive set includes three convenient sizes to cater to all your entertaining and styling needs: a grand 16 x 10 inch, a practical 14 x 8 inch, and a charming 12 x 6 inch. Whether you\'re hosting a lavish dinner party, enjoying a tranquil breakfast in bed, or simply infusing a touch of regal sophistication into your living space, these wooden trays are the ideal choice.<br></h2>\n    </li>\n    <hr>\n    <hr>\n    <h2><br></h2>\n</ul>','<table class=\"a-normal a-spacing-micro\" role=\"list\"><tbody><tr class=\"a-spacing-small po-brand\" role=\"listitem\"><td class=\"a-span3\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Brand</strong></td><td class=\"a-span9\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>SK Prints</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"a-spacing-small po-color\" role=\"listitem\"><td class=\"a-span3\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Colour</strong></td><td class=\"a-span9\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Multicolour</strong><br></td></tr><tr class=\"a-spacing-small po-item_length_width_height\" role=\"listitem\"><td class=\"a-span3\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Product Dimensions</strong></td><td class=\"a-span9\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>29L x 9W x 43H Centimeters</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"a-spacing-small po-item_shape\" role=\"listitem\"><td class=\"a-span3\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Shape</strong></td><td class=\"a-span9\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Rectangular</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"a-spacing-small po-tray_type\" role=\"listitem\"><td class=\"a-span3\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Tray Type</strong></td><td class=\"a-span9\" role=\"presentation\"><strong>Serving Tray</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 class=\"a-size-base-plus a-text-bold\"><strong>About this item</strong></h1><ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\"><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Premium Quality Wood: Durable and long-lasting construction.</strong></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Stunning Gold Engraving: Adds a touch of luxury and elegance.</strong></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Waterproof Enamel Coating: Easy to clean and resistant to spills.</strong></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Versatile Rectangular Design: Ideal for serving, organizing, or decorating.</strong></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Set of 3 Sizes: 16x10\", 14x8\", and 12x6\" to meet all your needs.</strong></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><strong>Ideal Gift: A thoughtful and stylish present for housewarmings, weddings, or any special occasion.</strong></li></ul>',3999.00,60,12,10,5,11,'\"[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605632930-79348285.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":true},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605638943-719815645.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605638943-840159950.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605638944-686591000.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605638944-107033657.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785605641902-137794446.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false}]\"','\"[]\"','[]','\"[]\"',1,0,1,0,1,0.0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-01 17:37:35','2026-08-02 17:03:43'),(29,1,'Raised Foil Business Cards','raised-foil-business-cards','VCPVF_001','<h3 id=\"tips-for-spot-uv-visiting-cards\">Tips for Spot UV visiting cards</h3><ul class=\"swan-list\"><li class=\"\"><h2>🔹Use spot UV to highlight any design element you want to emphasize.</h2></li><li class=\"\"><h2>🔹Choose high-contrast colours to take full advantage of the glossy effect.</h2></li><li class=\"\"><h2>🔹Spot UV is perfect for bold text and large text fields (10 pt. font or larger).</h2></li><h3 id=\"paper-options\">Paper Options</h3><p>🔹Choose between 400 gsm paper with Velvet lamination + Spot UV and 400 gsm premium paper with Velvet lamination + Spot UV</p><h3 id=\"creative-ways-to-use-your-visiting-cards\">Creative ways to use your visiting cards.</h3><p>🔹Are you looking for something specific? Check out these on-trend templates for Spot UV visiting cards –&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/property-estate-agents-industry/real-estate-development\">Real Estate Development</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/beauty-spa-industry\">Beauty &amp; Spa</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/house-constructions-repairs-industry/welding-metal-work\">Welding &amp; Metal</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/house-constructions-repairs-industry/painting-decorating\">Painting &amp; Decorating</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/house-constructions-repairs-industry/building-construction\">Building Construction</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/retro-vintage-styles-themes\">Retro &amp; Vintage</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/automotive-transportation-industry/auto-dealers\">Auto Dealers</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/automotive-transportation-industry/car-wash-valeting\">Car Wash &amp; Valeting</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/travel-accommodation-industry\">Travel &amp; Accommodation</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates/house-constructions-repairs-industry/pest-control\">Pest Control</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/business-cards/spot-uv/templates\">more</a>.</p><p><br>🔹For Bulk orders exceeding Rs. 20,000 in value, contact our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.in/customer-care/help-centre/\">Customer Care</a>&nbsp;for any assistance.</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;🔹Vistaprint India customizes all its products in facilities located within India. Some of our raw materials, intermediate components, and consumables used in the manufacturing of the final product could be from one or more countries. As we follow Global Sourcing, one product is likely to have a different country of origin depending on the batch sold.</p></ul>','<ul class=\"swan-list\"><li class=\"\"><strong>▶️ Spot UV Finish can be applied only on the front side of the cards</strong></li><li class=\"\"><strong>▶️ Spot UV will have a glossy finish applied on the areas</strong></li><li class=\"\"><strong> ▶️ selected while designing your card</strong></li><li class=\"\">▶️ <strong>High Quality 400 GSM Cards<br>▶️ Matte &amp; Glossy Finish</strong></li><li class=\"\">▶️<strong> Unique &amp; Creative Designs</strong></li><li class=\"\">▶️<strong> 400 GSM Thick Paper<br>▶️Velvet Touch Finish</strong><br>▶️<strong> Gold Foil Printing<br>▶️ Premium &amp; Luxury Look<br>▶️ Smooth Matte Feel</strong><br>▶️<strong>Title me “Premium / Luxury / 2026 / Trending” words use karo<br>▶️Thumbnail me black + gold ya dark blue + silver use karo<br>▶️ Short videos (YouTube Shorts) bhi upload karo (fast growth milega)</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Your business is one of a kind. Shouldn’t your visiting cards be unique, too? Spot UV creates a look and feel that’s different from the norm. We use a raised, clear polymer to make your text, logo and visuals stand out with a 3D, glossy shine which makes you stand out in front of your customers.</p><ul class=\"swan-list\"><li class=\"\"><strong><br></strong></li></ul><p><br></p>',4000.00,50,18,100,5,2,'\"[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382678-713647049.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":true},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382679-92208271.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382679-143392506.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382680-237780459.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382681-398363530.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382682-320283775.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382683-995654792.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"/uploads/1785606382684-160830500.jpg\\\",\\\"isPrimary\\\":false}]\"','\"[]\"','[]','\"[]\"',1,1,1,0,1,0.0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-01 17:49:01','2026-08-02 17:03:37');
